/**
\fn pdg::Scene::nearestPoint(Point point, number maxDistance, CollisionQueryOptions options)
\brief Find the closest point on matching filled geometry.
Points inside a shape return themselves at distance zero. This is not a signed
distance or nearest-boundary search inside geometry.
\param point World search point.
\param maxDistance Finite nonnegative inclusive search distance.
\param options Optional selection; see \ref scene_collision_query_options.
\return Closest hit or null. Valid until the next query on this scene or disposal.
*/
